exports[`golden 快照 > broken.md > 诊断 1`] = `
"error[DOC-101] 这份文档要求 spec 2，当前编译器只支持 spec 1
  --> broken.md:2:1
  |
2 | spec: 2
  | ^^^^
  |
  = 升级 pamphlet：npm i -g @nekoleapuki/pamphlet-cli@latest
  https://lazygophers.github.io/pamphlet/reference/diagnostics.html#doc-101

warning[DOC-102] frontmatter 里有未知字段 diagrams，已忽略
  --> broken.md:3:1
  |
3 | diagrams: mermaid
  | ^^^^^^^^
  |
  = 本版本认识的字段：spec / title / theme / lang / toc / engines
  https://lazygophers.github.io/pamphlet/reference/diagnostics.html#doc-102

error[DIR-203] 指令 :::tabs 没有闭合
  --> broken.md:8:1
  |
8 | ::::tabs
  | ^^^^^^^^
  |
  = 在它的内容之后补一行 ::::（闭合的冒号数要不少于开启的）
  https://lazygophers.github.io/pamphlet/reference/diagnostics.html#dir-203

error[DIR-204] tab 缺少指令标题
  --> broken.md:9:1
  |
9 | :::tab
  | ^
  |
  = 指令标题写在方括号里：:::tab[指令标题]。Tab 的指令标题就是那个可以点的按钮
  https://lazygophers.github.io/pamphlet/reference/diagnostics.html#dir-204

warning[DIR-201] 未知指令 calout，内容已按普通段落输出
   --> broken.md:13:1
   |
13 | :::calout
   | ^
   |
   = 是不是想写 callout？四种提示块是 info / tip / warn / danger
   https://lazygophers.github.io/pamphlet/reference/diagnostics.html#dir-201"
`;

